28:     - Exactly two diagonal blocks of that footprint are filled with the foreground color; the other two are background.
29: 
30:     Rule
31:     - Preserve the input.
32:     - If the filled blocks are northwest/southeast, paint teal blocks just outside the northeast and southwest corners.
33:     - If the filled blocks are northeast/southwest, paint teal blocks just outside the northwest and southeast corners.
34:     - Clip any painted block at the grid boundary.
