7: # concepts:
8: # Expanding, Framing, Growing
9: 
10: # description:
11: # In the input you will see some squares of different sizes and colors.
12: # To make the output, you need to:
13: # 1. Expand the squares down to the bottom of the grid using the color BLUE.
14: # 2. Draw a green frame around the squares. The green square should be twice as long as the original square.
15: # 3. Put the original square back to the center of the green square.
